{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼あすか、まりか、ひめか／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/04/0675224/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かかか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MV公開されたーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/04/0675224/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪13日の金曜日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこでちょっと公開されたけど\nフルではいかがでしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フラッシュモブ。\nなんかうまく言えないけど、\nああやって自由にダンスして\nノリノリなのだいすきなんだよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/04/0675224/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真洋とよくやる感じの♪←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影してそのままバスに乗って\n帰ったからね笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイトルの13日の金曜日ですが、\n調べたらあのホラー映画の画像が...\nうおお...心臓に悪い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"安心して。乃木坂46の\n13日の金曜日はとっても明るい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌詞を聴いたらなんで\nこのタイトルなのかわかるよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/04/0675224/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は絶対デートでホラー映画みれん。\nというかデートでなくてもみれん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスの最後のポーズ、\nがうっち"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/04/0675224/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/04/0675224/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/04/0675224/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私実際言ってるからそこにも注目←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪シャキイズム"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はね...私が1st個人pv「ナイフ」で\nお世話になった監督さんなのです！\nとっても素敵な作品なので、\n見ていない方はぜひ。\n監督さんに久しぶりにお会いできて\n嬉しかったなあ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影した学校、あの教室も\n個人pvと一緒なのですよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＭＶの内容が斬新！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"監視カメラ、男女のガラスの壁\nモニター、猛男のマスク...\n全てがツボでした。\nかっこいいいいいい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それにしても男役のみんな\nかっこよすぎて撮影どころじゃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/04/0675224/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして先生役の嶋田久作さん、\nとても素敵な方でした...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終始でれでれしてました。\n自分気持ち悪かった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さあみんな！\n13日の金曜日、シャキイズム\n部屋で大音量で聴こう！！！\nひゃっふい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/04/0675224/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/04/0675224/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/04/0675224/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/04/0675224/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/04/0675224/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここで問題。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は男役か女役\nどっちだったでしょうか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/04/0675224/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男でした。ちゃっちゃらーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男はシャキッと！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}